# Original INSTALL.EXE from C:\XWING: "Set Sound Board Configuration" -> "AdLib and
# compatibles", then Exit, declining the READ.ME. Leaving the installer writes LANDRU.CFG
# and OPTIONS.CFG. Steps are documented in src/misc/xwing_script.cpp of the patched DOSBox-X.
text MAIN MENU
delay 1000
key down
delay 500
key enter
text SOUND CARD MENU
delay 1000
# No Sound is first; AdLib and compatibles second
key down
delay 500
key enter
text Sound Card Setting:        AdLib
delay 1000
# Exit is the fifth main-menu item
key down down down down
delay 500
key enter
text Do you wish to read it now?
delay 500
key n
notext Do you wish to read it now?
delay 3000
done
